    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">We're Local Knowsley. Same Council as Huyton.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0;">Our office and stores are at <strong>29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL</strong>. Same Knowsley Council as Huyton. The M57 connects Kirkby and Huyton in 10 minutes. Most calls reach us inside 20 minutes from first phone call.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-top:0.75rem;">The other plumbers ranking for emergency plumber Huyton are based in Liverpool, Lancashire or are national call centres dispatching to whoever's nearest. We're the local Knowsley plumbers. Same vans you see at Kirkby Tesco, the M57 junctions and Huyton Village.</p>
