        <strong>No call-out fee</strong>
        <p>You pay our hourly rate from when we start work. The <a href="https://www.checkatrade.com/blog/cost-guides/plumber-call-out-fee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Checkatrade typical price for emergency plumber call-outs</a> in Liverpool runs £80 to £180 an hour. We sit at the bottom end.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
