        <a href="/radiators-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Radiator Repairs and Swaps</strong><span>New radiators from £200 supply and fit. TRV upgrades from £50. Common upgrade in Huyton's 1950s semis.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/showers-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Shower Installation and Repairs</strong><span>Electric showers from £200 supply and fit. Shower mixer from £300. Cartridge swaps from £100.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
